==Battleground==
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Zigge]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*2 [[Znache]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*1 [[Znache]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*5 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[H. Nah]]s spawn, delay 86.67~93.33 seconds<sup>2,600f~2,800f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**2 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 60~66.67 seconds<sup>1,800f~2,000f</sup>.
**1 [[Elder Sloth]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**2 [[Scissoroo]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**3 [[Znache]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**1 [[Zigge]] spawns after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
**2 [[Znache]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main gimmick of this stage is the fact that almost all enemies in the stage inflict knockback. While this could seem intimidating at first, the stage is rather simple as [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Mewtone]] outranges all the main threats in the level. Stack a few [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Housewife Cats]], partake in some jolly meatshielding with [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cat]], and everything should fall into place. Make sure to save your [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blast]] for the 2 Zang Roos that spawn 60 seconds apart from each other. Once both Zang Roos in the stage are dead, just let Mewtone chip down the remaining enemies until you win.

==Trivia==
*Undead City's Japanese name, Fushi-chō (不死街, Immortal Town"), is a pun on 不死鳥 ''fushichō'' ([[wikipedia:Phoenix (mythology)|phoenix]]) and 街 ''chō'' (town). Like a phoenix, the [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombies]] in the stage can come back to life.

